{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】樂施毅行者首度舉辦20公里賽事。</p>\n<p>一眾跑手在起點大帽山扶輪公園熱身做準備。漁農自然護理署署長黎堅明、立法會議員姚柏良、陳家珮、藝人周潤發等出席起跑禮，他們亦有參與20公里賽事。</p>\n<p>參加者要四人一隊，於8小時內走抵達終點屯門哈羅香港國際學校。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:43:59.008977+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:09:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T01:37:23.181134+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:37:23.181134+00:00","content_hash":"29b3102858d2168e0c7a5f6fabd13e8c0a798c71033885e6eb66204debdb0da2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}